# tools/p/pending_decision_witness.rish -- "what is waiting on me" gets one reading, not four.
#
# WHY THIS RUNG. active-designing/20260918-000154_three-numbers-and-a-name.md measured a decision
# parked in four places at once -- a forward-looking sentence naming Keaton's word, a sentence
# already recording a word granted, a `YOURS:` line on a living pin, and an `Open doors for
# Keaton` section -- and found nothing read them together. It proposed a scan rather than a new
# filing room, "reported and gated on nothing, since a pending decision is a state rather than a
# fault." This rung is that proposal, built.
#
# WHAT IS PROVEN, on a throwaway tree: a forward-looking sentence is told from an already-granted
# one by its verb, a `YOURS:` line and an `Open doors for Keaton` section are each counted, a
# dated shelf's own testimony is read past even when it carries the same words a living page would
# park with, a page naming neither reads free, and the scan always reports rather than gates.
#
# WHAT THIS RUNG STOPS AT. Every open sentence, gathered and named; whether one still matters, and
# whose lane it sits in, stays a question for the reader.
#
# Run from the repository root:
#   rishi/bin/rishi run tools/p/pending_decision_witness.rish

say "pending-decision: Language EN -- what is waiting on me, read once instead of guessed at four times."
say "pending-decision: Style Radiant -- the sentence itself is the record; the scan only gathers it."
say "pending-decision: Lens TAME -- report rather than gate, since an open decision is a state, not a fault."

let scan = run ["sh" "tools/fixtures/p/pending_decision_scan.sh"]
say scan.out
assert scan.ok else "pending-decision: the scan must complete on the living tree"
assert scan.out contains "verdict=reported" else "pending-decision: the scan always reports; it stays clear of gating"

let control = run ["sh" "tools/fixtures/p/pending_decision_control.sh"]
say control.out
assert control.ok else "pending-decision: the control must complete"
assert control.out contains "parked_bites=yes" else "pending-decision: a forward-looking sentence naming Keaton's word must be counted parked"
assert control.out contains "granted_bites=yes" else "pending-decision: an already-seated sentence belongs in granted rather than parked"
assert control.out contains "yours_bites=yes" else "pending-decision: a YOURS: line must be counted"
assert control.out contains "doors_bites=yes" else "pending-decision: every bullet under Open doors for Keaton must be counted"
assert control.out contains "dated_shelf_free=yes" else "pending-decision: a dated shelf's own testimony must read past, even carrying the same words"
assert control.out contains "clean_case_free=yes" else "pending-decision: a plain page, carrying neither marker, still reads free"
assert control.out contains "reports_never_gates=yes" else "pending-decision: the scan must report rather than gate"
assert control.out contains "control_verdict=ok" else "pending-decision: the control must agree with itself"
say "four places, one reading -- parked told from granted, YOURS: and Open doors each counted, testimony read past"

say "GREEN: pending-decision -- what is waiting on me now has one answer instead of four partial ones."
